---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
---
<Layout>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="app-layout py-10 sm:py-14">
    <p class="text-foreground/45 mb-2 text-xs tracking-[0.18em] uppercase">Compare</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">U 卡对比</h1>
    <p class="text-foreground/60 mt-4 max-w-xl leading-7">对比功能将在卡片数据结构稳定后开发。V1 先保证内容、评测和基础目录可用，不提前堆复杂筛选与参数表。</p>
    <a href="/cards" class="text-accent mt-8 inline-block text-sm">先查看 U 卡目录 →</a>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
